# Remote (SEL + GLO): the panel plays ECO-1 in the browser over USB MIDI, channel 16, and the FM-1 goes
# quiet; the browser answers with CC 117. SEL + GLO again (any order of letting go): back, growing again.
wait 2000
expect playing 1
press SEL
press GLO
wait 100
release SEL
release GLO
wait 300
expect remote 1
expect playing 0
expect view 0
midi BF 75 7F
wait 300
expect remote 2
press SEL
press GLO
wait 100
release GLO
release SEL
wait 500
expect remote 0
expect playing 1
expect view 0
tap GLO
wait 200
expect view 8
